# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Users should add all user specific configuration changes after these
# comments, as a YAML snippet mirroring the structure of Omega's default
# configuration (components/omega/configs/Default.yml). Only the options
# being changed need to be listed. For example:
#
#   Omega:
#     TimeIntegration:
#       TimeStep: "0000_00:10:00"
#     IOStreams:
#       InitialState:
#         Filename: /absolute/path/to/initial_state.nc
#       History:
#         Freq: 1
#         FreqUnits: months
#
# *** THE FOLLOWING CANNOT BE CHANGED ***
# They are set from the case configuration, or by the coupler at runtime:
#   1. TimeIntegration: StartTime, StopTime, RunDuration, CalendarType
#   2. IOStreams: HorzMeshIn, Forcing, RestartRead, and RestartWrite.
#      Only Filename may be changed for InitialVertCoord and InitialState.
#      The History and Highfreq streams may be changed, as may any new
#      stream you define.
#
# Initial-condition filenames must be absolute paths. If netCDF4 and the
# default mesh file are available, the files are checked against the mesh.
# Different vertical layer counts produce warnings; use compatible files
# for InitialState and InitialVertCoord.
#
# To preview the configuration, invoke $CASEROOT/preview_namelists and look
# at $CASEROOT/CaseDocs/omega.yml
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
